Consider the second-order linear ordinary differential equation [latex]x^2\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}+x\frac{dy}{dx}-y=0,\;\; x \geq 1[/latex] with the initial conditions [latex]y(x=1)=6,\;\;\left.\begin{matrix}
\frac{dy}{dx}
\end{matrix}\right|_{x=1}=2[/latex] The value of [latex]y[/latex] at [latex]x=2[/latex]   equals _________. (Answer in integer)

